---
title: How do I check the activities of an invoice?
sidebar:
  order: 10
---
**To check the activities of an invoice, follow these steps:**

1. **Navigate to the “Invoices” Section:**

   - **Click on the Invoices tab on the left-hand sidebar.**

1. **Select the Invoice to Preview:**

   - **Locate the invoice for which you want to see the activities.**
   - **Click on the three dots (⋮) next to the invoice.**
   - **From the dropdown menu, select “Preview Invoice”.**

1. **View Invoice Details and Activities:**

   - **In the invoice preview page, scroll down to the “Activities” section on the right-hand side.**
   - **Here, you’ll see a timeline of all activities related to the invoice, such as status changes, updates, and payment actions.**

**This timeline provides a detailed history of actions taken on that particular invoice.**
